 The secondary gamma-ray spectrum for radiative capture (MF 12,   2631 1451   16
 MT 102) has been updated for new experimental data at incident   2631 1451   17
 neutron energies up to 1 keV.                                    2631 1451   18
 The MF=12, MT=102 yields above 1 keV were adjusted slightly to   2631 1451   19
 force energy conservation.                                       2631 1451   20
 The Q-value for radiative capture was also updated in File 3.    2631 1451   21
 Details of these changes are described in Frankel et al. [Fr01]. 2631 1451   22
