                                                                  2631 1451  191
   ORNL-4617 [PE71] describes ENDF/B-3.  Major revisions for      2631 1451  192
 ENDF/B-4 and -5 are summarized in ORNL/TM-7523 [FU80] and        2631 1451  193
 ORNL/TM-8283 [FU82].  The present evaluation is based on the     2631 1451  194
 calculations described in ORNL/TM-9964 [FU86].  The major        2631 1451  195
 improvements over ENDF-5 MOD3 are:                               2631 1451  196
   1. Evaluation is now isotopic.                                 2631 1451  197
   2. Analysis is based on a new TNG code much improved over      2631 1451  198
 the version used for ENDF/B-5 for calculating energy-angle       2631 1451  199
 correlated spectra.                                              2631 1451  200
   3. Resonance parameters are extended from 400 keV to 850 keV   2631 1451  201
 [Pe89].                                                          2631 1451  202
   4. NEW DATA SETS [PA88,LA85,MA83,TA83,FU82,FR80,AR80,GR79,     2631 1451  203
HA89] ARE INCORPORATED.                                           2631 1451  204
   5. INTEGRAL RESULTS [MA85,PA85,CR76,JO75] ARE CONSIDERED FOR   2631 1451  205
THE (N,N') EVALUATION ABOVE 3 MEV.                                2631 1451  206
   6. GAMMA-RAY PRODUCTION CROSS SECTIONS AND SPECTRA ARE GIVEN   2631 1451  207
FOR EACH REACTION,INCLUDING MT = 51-75, INSTEAD OF FOR THE        2631 1451  208
NONELASTIC.                                                       2631 1451  209
   7. RECOIL SPECTRA ARE GIVEN IN FILE-6.                         2631 1451  210
   8. CHARGED PARTICLE SPECTRA ARE GIVEN.                         2631 1451  211
                                                                  2631 1451  212
   THE FOLLOWING DESCRIPTION FOR EACH FILE AND SECTION IS FOR     2631 1451  213
